    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RABIT is a simple but challenging 2D platformer with multiple movement abilities and the power to toggle certain blocks on and off on a whim. Toggle, dash, wall-jump and stomp your way to the top of a mysterious virtual world - and maybe even uncover some of its forgotten history along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your high scores on a classic arcade-style top 10 screen, entering your initials as you would on an classic arcade cabinet. Then check out your friend's high scores on the steam leaderboard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RABIT is a simple but challenging 2D platformer with multiple movement abilities and the power to toggle certain blocks on and off on a whim. Toggle, dash, wall-jump and stomp your way to the top of a mysterious virtual world - and maybe even uncover some of its forgotten history along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your high scores on a classic arcade-style top 10 screen, entering your initials as you would on an classic arcade cabinet. Then check out your friend's high scores on the steam leaderboard.</p>",
    "short_description": "RABIT is an arcade style platforming game with retro graphics and a mysterious atmosphere. It's central mechanic is the ability to toggle certain objects on and off at the click of a button. This along with several other movement abilities allows for some devious and exciting platforming sections.",
